        }
      ],
      "impact": "The MCU backup domain, RTC and backup registers are not properly supplied, and a floating VBAT pin can cause unpredictable backup-domain behavior or leakage. The main MCU may still run from VDD, but this is a supply-pin open-circuit deviation.",
